            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;Your request has been submitted. The accounts will be updated in some time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
